# 38. PERFORMANCE AUDIT

Look for:

* unnecessary process spawning
* synchronous filesystem I/O
* repeated database queries
* unnecessary UI refreshes
* excessive allocations
* unbounded collections
* timers running indefinitely
* polling loops
* runaway retries

Do not optimize blindly.

Measure or reason from concrete hot paths.

