```

If a test fails:

```text
READ FAILURE
↓
TRACE ROOT CAUSE
↓
FIX ROOT CAUSE
↓
ADD/UPDATE REGRESSION TEST
↓
RERUN
```

Do not repeatedly rerun unchanged failing tests.

